{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B95ubecBhc6toutZ9x7Y5G","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Mistral Vibe CLI disable telemetry update checks\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - mistralai/mistral-vibe: Minimal CLI coding agent by Mistral · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mistralai/mistral-vibe\"},{\"title\":\"mistral-vibe/README.md at main · mistralai/mistral-vibe\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mistralai/mistral-vibe/blob/main/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"Extension settings | Mistral Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/vs-code-extension/settings\"},{\"title\":\"mistral-vibe · PyPI\",\"url\":\"https://pypi.org/project/mistral-vibe/\"},{\"title\":\"Using offline models | Mistral Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/offline-models\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli: Minimal CLI coding agent by Mistral · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli/tree/main\"},{\"title\":\"mistral-vibe-cli/README.md at main · ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli/blob/main/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"Configuration | Mistral Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/configuration\"},{\"title\":\"Admin config | Mistral Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/admin-config\"},{\"title\":\"Stop Wrestling with Copilot! Mistral Vibe Is the CLI Agent | Bright Coding\",\"url\":\"https://www.blog.brightcoding.dev/2026/06/05/stop-wrestling-with-copilot-mistral-vibe-is-the-cli-agent-you-actually-need\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's how to disable telemetry and update checks in Mistral Vibe CLI:\n\n**Disabling Telemetry:**\nYou can disable telemetry and crash reporting in your config.toml by setting enable_telemetry = false.\n\n**Disabling Update Checks:**\nTo disable the daily check entirely, add this to your config.toml by setting `enable_auto_update = false`.\n\n**Configuration File Location:**\nBy default, Vibe stores its configuration in ~/.vibe/, so you'll be editing `~/.vibe/config.toml`.\n\n**Example Configuration:**\nFor complete offline operation, set the following in ~/.vibe/config.toml: enable_telemetry = false enable_auto_update = false\n\nThese settings will prevent the CLI from performing automatic update checks and from collecting telemetry data.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0063ba9-efb2-4cd3-aabb-6f06f1ab2edb","uuid":"62b454fd-cdf4-4e97-972a-a2db867b0472","timestamp":"2026-09-11T19:44:20.866Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Mistral Vibe CLI disable telemetry update checks","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01DfQRBgojFVZyXMcNTPbUYz","content":[{"title":"GitHub - mistralai/mistral-vibe: Minimal CLI coding agent by Mistral · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/mistralai/mistral-vibe"},{"title":"mistral-vibe/README.md at main · mistralai/mistral-vibe","url":"https://github.com/mistralai/mistral-vibe/blob/main/README.md"},{"title":"Extension settings | Mistral Docs","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/vs-code-extension/settings"},{"title":"mistral-vibe · PyPI","url":"https://pypi.org/project/mistral-vibe/"},{"title":"Using offline models | Mistral Docs","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/offline-models"},{"title":"GitHub - ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli: Minimal CLI coding agent by Mistral · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli/tree/main"},{"title":"mistral-vibe-cli/README.md at main · ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli","url":"https://github.com/ajnart/mistral-vibe-cli/blob/main/README.md"},{"title":"Configuration | Mistral Docs","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/configuration"},{"title":"Admin config | Mistral Docs","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/admin-config"},{"title":"Stop Wrestling with Copilot! Mistral Vibe Is the CLI Agent | Bright Coding","url":"https://www.blog.brightcoding.dev/2026/06/05/stop-wrestling-with-copilot-mistral-vibe-is-the-cli-agent-you-actually-need"}]},"Based on the search results, here's how to disable telemetry and update checks in Mistral Vibe CLI:\n\n**Disabling Telemetry:**\nYou can disable telemetry and crash reporting in your config.toml by setting enable_telemetry = false.\n\n**Disabling Update Checks:**\nTo disable the daily check entirely, add this to your config.toml by setting `enable_auto_update = false`.\n\n**Configuration File Location:**\nBy default, Vibe stores its configuration in ~/.vibe/, so you'll be editing `~/.vibe/config.toml`.\n\n**Example Configuration:**\nFor complete offline operation, set the following in ~/.vibe/config.toml: enable_telemetry = false enable_auto_update = false\n\nThese settings will prevent the CLI from performing automatic update checks and from collecting telemetry data."],"durationSeconds":4.60870509,"searchCount":1}}
