{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019GZjA6j2rDqQ4TiENtRVQz","type":"tool_result","content":"To disable telemetry and update checks in Vibe CLI, modify your `~/.vibe/config.toml` file with these settings:\n\n```toml\nenable_auto_update = false\nenable_telemetry = false\n```\n\nAccording to the documentation, \"enable_auto_update\" controls whether Vibe automatically checks for and installs new releases, while \"enable_telemetry\" manages the transmission of anonymous usage and error data to Mistral. Both default to `true`, but you can set them to `false` to opt out. Note that disabling auto-updates means you'll need to manually update by rerunning the install script."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0063ba9-efb2-4cd3-aabb-6f06f1ab2edb","uuid":"ed2aca4f-1e40-4e26-b8a3-d067245a11ff","timestamp":"2026-09-11T19:44:28.477Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1216104,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"To disable telemetry and update checks in Vibe CLI, modify your `~/.vibe/config.toml` file with these settings:\n\n```toml\nenable_auto_update = false\nenable_telemetry = false\n```\n\nAccording to the documentation, \"enable_auto_update\" controls whether Vibe automatically checks for and installs new releases, while \"enable_telemetry\" manages the transmission of anonymous usage and error data to Mistral. Both default to `true`, but you can set them to `false` to opt out. Note that disabling auto-updates means you'll need to manually update by rerunning the install script.","durationMs":2479,"url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/cli/configuration"}}
